vulkan-game
  server.cpp                server application, authoritative world and rules
  client.cpp                client application and input settings
  srv/                      simulation, game scene serialization and authority
  clt/                      rendering integration, player and weapon presentation
  shd/                      game material, compute lighting and presentation GLSL
  assets/                   game-owned art

Uses VulkanEngine and VulkanSystems static libraries pinned in build.c.
The generic GPU owners, descriptor resources, frame scheduler, HDR/LDR
postprocessing targets, indirect culler, IPv4/IPv6 UDP sockets, reliable
scene byte transport, spatial queries and jobs are provided by VulkanSystems.
The game keeps its scene batch serialization, gameplay handshake, animation,
input prediction, weapons and authoritative server simulation.

vulkan-server and vulkan-client must use matching builds; VSN1 reliable scene
delivery supersedes the old VSCN per-fragment request/response protocol.
Transport is currently unencrypted, and source changes require native
compilation and runtime tests on the supported platforms.
